{
  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "flugon to Cartaina \u00fe\u00e6re byrg, & gegaderodon Sume o\u00feflugon to Cretan \u00fe\u00e6m iglande. & him Scipia sende sciphere \u00e6fter, \u00fe\u00e6t mon sume ofslog, sume gefeng. & Sifax wear\u00f0 gefangen, hiera o\u00feer cyning, & si\u00fe\u00fean w\u00e6s to Rome on racentan sended. On \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohtum w\u00e6ron Pene swa forhiende \u00fe\u00e6t hie na si\u00fe\u00fean hie wi\u00fe Romane to nohte ne & he him wepende \u00fe\u00e6re bene getyg\u00f0ade, for \u00feon \u00fee he sceolde Italiam forl\u00e6tan, on \u00fe\u00e6m & he ealle ofslog \u00fee of \u00fe\u00e6m landum his men w\u00e6ron, & mid him ofer s\u00e6 nolden. \u00dea he hamweard seglde, \u00fea het he \u00e6nne mon stigan on \u00feone m\u00e6st, & locian hw\u00e6\u00feer he \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00dea s\u00e6de he him \u00fe\u00e6t he gesawe ane tobrocene byrgenne, swelce hiera \u00feeaw w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t mon ricum \u00dea w\u00e6s Hannibale \u00e6fter hiera h\u00e6\u00f0eniscum gewunan \u00fe\u00e6t andwyrde swi\u00fee la\u00f0, & him un\u00feanc & ealne \u00feone here he het mid \u00fe\u00e6m scipum \u00feonan wendan \u00fee he \u00e6r to ge\u00feoht h\u00e6fde, & up Ac he hiera sundorspr\u00e6ce, \u00fee hie betux \u00fe\u00e6m folcum tog\u00e6dereweard gespr\u00e6can, to unsibbe & ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee hie tog\u00e6dere comon, Hannibales folc wear\u00f0 gefliemed, & XX M ofslagen & D, \u00dea sendon \u00fea burgleode of Cartaina \u00e6fter Hannibale, & cw\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t him soelest w\u00e6re \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00dea",
